. ** PART VI - HETEROGENEITY BY EDUCATION AND SALT EXPOSURE (Table 6)
. ********************************************************************************
. **  Note: income tercile splits removed - they are collinear with i.famincome
. **  controls (treatment_ind is itself defined by famincome categories).
